comment0.text=\r\n\ A\ triangle\ that\ can\ be\ manipulated\ and\ that\ draws\ itself\ on\ a\ canvas.\r\n\ \r\n\ @author\ \ Michael\ Kolling\ and\ David\ J.\ Barnes\r\n\ @version\ 1.0\ \ (15\ July\ 2000)\r\n
